<title>GERMANY: Degussa Q1 pre-tax profit rises 20 pct.</title>
<headline>Degussa Q1 pre-tax profit rises 20 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>First three months of business year ending Sept 30 (in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group sales				    3,462   vs  2,973</p>
<p>    - Chemical products			  952     vs  883</p>
<p>    - Health and Nutrition		     726     vs  662</p>
<p>    - Precious metals and bank		 1,784   vs  1,428</p>
<p>    Domestic sales				 853     vs  788</p>
<p>    Foreign sales				  2,609   vs  2,185</p>
<p>    Group Pre-tax profit			 115     vs  96</p>
<p>    Group workforce on Dec 31		  25,859  vs  26,133</p>
<p>    Group Personnel costs			636     vs  609</p>
<p>    Parent sales				   1,729   vs 1,441</p>
<p>    Parent pre-tax profit			44	vs 34</p>
<p>    Parent workforce on Dec 31		 9,454   vs 9,937</p>
<p>    Parent personnel costs		     277     vs 280</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German chemicals and metals group is Degussa AG.</p>
</text>
